    {
      "name": "places/ChIJi4t5NBzzaS4RpqvvgD1NJmQ/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURlanB5cTlRRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 years ago",
      "rating": 4,
      "text": {
        "text": "This place divided into 3 area. If you want to do some work with comfortable seat, you'd better use the indoor area in front of the barista table. If you need to chill with friends, the outdoor area is the best place. And if you want to gather with some friend and need privacy, you'd better use the karaoke room at the upstairs without charge, the barista said you only need to make a minimum order 500k to use that room for 2 hours.\n\nSince this is my first visit, I only order for 2 glasses of iced coffee. At the first i ordered baileys coffee and it tasted good but the second menu, I tried their authentic menu and request to be served less sugar..hmmm I don't think it's recommended.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "This place divided into 3 area. If you want to do some work with comfortable seat, you'd better use the indoor area in front of the barista table. If you need to chill with friends, the outdoor area is the best place. And if you want to gather with some friend and need privacy, you'd better use the karaoke room at the upstairs without charge, the barista said you only need to make a minimum order 500k to use that room for 2 hours.\n\nSince this is my first visit, I only order for 2 glasses of iced coffee. At the first i ordered baileys coffee and it tasted good but the second menu, I tried their authentic menu and request to be served less sugar..hmmm I don't think it's recommended.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
